<Learn
  path="/learn/ai-readiness-assessment-uae/"
  lede="An AI readiness assessment looks at how your teams really work and tells you, team by team, where AI will save time and money and where it will not. A good one is done on site, ends in a written report with costs and payback, and comes from someone who sells no tools."
  outline={OUTLINE}
